			<div class="content" id="post-content-4826860">
									

<p><strong>seeking to greenlight:</strong> yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP article</p>
<p><strong>Page layout:</strong> Interview log and Body cam</p>
<p><strong>Genre:</strong> Mystery</p>
<p><strong>Elevator pitch:</strong> This SCP is a Mongolian (Khun) teenage boy that can manipulate any natural structure and can create a giant creature that is a snake. However, it can't manifest creatures if it nor surrounded by any natural habitats, is incredibly sensitive to fire.<br />
there's SCP-1 where it is a hole in a destroyed mining factory leading down to a cave. And it seems the anomaly is protecting the cave.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Central&nbsp;Narrative</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Central&nbsp;Narrative</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>After mass death and disappearance of local cattle and animals. And destruction major mining factory The Foundation dispatched a research team to try to find out what this SCP is. they found out that this SCP is known among the locals as a fairy tale and folklore making it alive since the Khun era. They learned from the locals that there was a huge abandoned mining factory somewhere near the district, saying it has some kind of presence.</p>
<ul>
<li>MTF- Zeta-9 with average equipment and firearms for the exploratory mission. team leader Olson. Agent Luna, Ouyulan, Zachary, and Sunder.</li>
<li>they're communication completely cuts off once they enter the dark zone, they shine a light and saw a snake-like creature big as skyscrapers on the walls. the cave expands, as further they go, and the light gradually returns, revealing a whole echo system with animal same as above but made out of natural components.</li>
<li>the snake attacks the team. Zachary and Ouyulan are eaten, the remaining three had no choice but to go down further.</li>
<li>They wander the place until they found wast space with what it seemed to be a ger (Yurt) in the middle and behind that was a dozen branch people<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-527589-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-527589-1')">1</a></sup> facing the sky. they travel through the crowd and Agent Olson loses two agents among them.</li>
<li>Agent Olson talks about the fairy tale that Agent Ouyulan told him. Saying that it isn't a small child fairy tale but a prophecy and the shepherd boy will reunite with his people when the prophecy is fulfilled.</li>
<li>the body cam began to sink into the ground and dragged above the surface, and we see the recovery team picking up the camera.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention:</strong> I decided to change the central narrative completely.</p>
