<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">[+]&nbsp;Open&nbsp;for&nbsp;crit</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>Dr Narangerel interviewed the entity and found out it has home which was an cave underneath a destroyed mining factory.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>How does this interview happen? There's kinda a jump from &quot;we sent a research team to find out what the SCP is&quot; to &quot;we interviewed it&quot; and I'm not sure how you're like&#8230;getting from A to B here?</p>
<p>My kinda concern here is this feels like a lot of preamble that's not hugely interesting when the real meat is the MTF team exploring the cave; and it feels like just a handwave 'locals claim the cave is haunted' in a discovery section would be the best way to convey this so you can go from giving vague description of entity to the actual exploration log that's the real joy here as quick as possible?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>remaining three had no choice but to go down further.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I'm a little unclear on why they have no choice but to go down further. The snake attack kinda feels like a 'go back now' kinda action so it seems like it shouldn't be blocking their access but?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>they travel through the crowd and Agent Olson loses two agent among them.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>How does Olson lose two agents here? The phrasing is kinda vague but it seems like there's some kinda cognitohazardous affect here forcing people to give worship? But it also seems plausible that there's just, the sinkhole thing at play here?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>the shepherd boy will reunite with his people when the prophecy is fulfilled.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>who are his people? what is the prophecy?</p>
<hr />
<p>I want to emphasise: these are all minor concerns. I think you have a good idea of what you want to do here and I'm just trying to get a feel for the broader picture of what's going on.</p>
<p>My&#8230;biggest concern is actually the quality of writing: there's quite a lot of slightly janky english writing here and my worry is that I'm not sure if your english is good enough to make this work. It might be worth trying to find a coauthor<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-931547-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-931547-1')">1</a></sup>, or checking the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-international">International Branches hub</a> to see whether there's a language you're more comfortable using available there?</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
